                       <remarks versionDate="2016-06-21" xml:lang="en">
                           <p><hi rend="bold">NB:</hi> This element is currently only used as a container for <gi>ref</gi> elements for footnotes on certain types of section titles, such as CD Notes, Annotations and the like. These are rendered as superscripted numbers immediately following the title CD Notes, Annotations, etc in the print and online version, <hi rend="superscript">e.g.</hi> <hi rend="smallCaps">CD Notes</hi> <hi rend="superscript">3</hi>.</p>
